WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
This is the cake we make at home whenever it is somebody's birthday.

2
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.960
It is simple and we all adore it.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.610
First I cook a vanilla pudding, cover it and leave it to cool.

4
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.760
Meanwhile I whip the butter until fluffy and add powdered sugar.

5
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.450
Then I add the mixture to the pudding and divide it into three equal parts.

6
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:23.520
Into the first part I add ground Plazma biscuit, into the second coarsely ground hazelnuts and a bit more Plazma, and into the third melted dark chocolate.

7
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.320
Then I layer them in order: first the layer with Plazma, then the one with hazelnuts and finally the chocolate one.

8
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.600
It goes to cool, then you just decorate it a little as you like and enjoy every bite.
